DESCRIPTION:👻  Whispers on Boston Street – Ghost Walk\n\nHistory. Hau
 ntings. Hometown Secrets.\n\nStep beyond the charming storefronts and sunny
  sidewalks into the shadowy stories of Chandler’s past on this 75-minute 
 guided walking ghost tour\, starting and ending at Mic Drop Comedy Chandler
  (📍 51 E Boston St\, Chandler\, AZ 85225 ).\n\nAs the sun dips low and t
 he streets grow quiet\, you’ll follow your guide through historic downtow
 n Chandler\, where whispers of the past still echo between the bricks. We
 ’ll journey through nearly a century of hidden history—from haunted hot
 els where the scent of cigar smoke hangs heavy in empty halls\, to ghostly 
 theaters where the reels still spin for no one. You’ll pass buildings whe
 re electricity first sparked to life—and may still flicker thanks to some
 thing unseen.\n\nHear tales of vanished cowboys\, mysterious phone calls fr
 om empty rooms\, unexplained cold spots\, and the eerie scent of old medici
 ne drifting through shuttered windows. These aren’t just ghost stories—
 they’re hometown legends\, stitched into the bones of Chandler itself.\n\
 nWhether you're a curious skeptic\, a paranormal enthusiast\, or just looki
 ng for a memorable night out\, this immersive tour promises a walk through 
 Chandler you’ll never forget—and may not want to walk alone.\n\n🎟️
